@page
@{ViewData["Title"]="About Us";ViewData["NavStyle"]="light";}
<section class="page-hero-light"><div class="container-fluid site-container"><div class="row align-items-center g-5"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="section-eyebrow">About us</span><h1>Serving humanity with speed, compassion and dignity.</h1><p>Gift of the Givers is a humanitarian disaster-response organisation of African origin. The platform connects donors, volunteers and employees through clear, accessible tools that support relief work and community response.</p><div class="d-flex gap-3 flex-wrap"><a class="btn btn-brand" asp-page="/Donate">Support the mission</a><a class="btn btn-outline-brand" asp-page="/Volunteer">Join as a volunteer</a></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="image-frame"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/35043674/pexels-photo-35043674.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1300" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/about-relief.jpg';" alt="Community outreach volunteers distributing supplies"/></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section-pad"><div class="container-fluid site-container"><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="value-card"><span><i class="bi bi-heart"></i></span><h2>Humanity</h2><p>People come first. Every workflow is designed to make support easier to give, coordinate and receive.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="value-card"><span><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i></span><h2>Integrity</h2><p>Role-based access, validation and stored records support responsible use of the platform.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="value-card"><span><i class="bi bi-eye"></i></span><h2>Transparency</h2><p>Donation records, tax certificates and project updates make activity visible and traceable.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section-pad bg-soft"><div class="container-fluid site-container"><div class="row g-5 align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-2"><span class="section-eyebrow">How the platform helps</span><h2 class="display-section">One platform, three clear journeys.</h2><div class="journey-list"><div><i class="bi bi-person-heart"></i><p><strong>Donors</strong><span>Register, login, donate in ZAR/USD/EUR, choose one-time or recurring, donate anonymously and access certificates.</span></p></div><div><i class="bi bi-people"></i><p><strong>Volunteers</strong><span>Submit personal information, skills and availability through a validated form.</span></p></div><div><i class="bi bi-person-badge"></i><p><strong>Employees</strong><span>Use a protected dashboard to manage relief projects, post updates and view sign-ups and donations.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-1"><img class="rounded-media" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/6590928/pexels-photo-6590928.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1300" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/about-community.jpg';" alt="Volunteers organising donation boxes" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div></section>
